FIRST: re-ran my exact attempt-3 winning probe (chart walk vs metrics.Calculate's
CombinedCumulativeBalance, same opposite-sign living/healthcare month, planExclusions=nil)
through the real, rewritten buildBudgetVsActualChartData:
