VERDICT: PASS. The spend-side merge-then-Abs fix genuinely and completely closes attempt 3's
regression (the chart's cumulative walk now agrees with metrics.Calculate's walk to within the
same disclosed, pre-existing, flag-independent noise floor, across every sign combination and
month-alignment edge case I could construct), the diff is confined to exactly the two files
claimed, and the new equality test is load-bearing rather than vacuous.
